# NOTE: src/data/ is generated from data/words/ by `npm run build:words`, but it IS
# committed. The mobile app imports it, and a cloud build (EAS) only ever sees
# committed files — it cannot run the web project's generation step first. Drift is
# guarded instead: build:words runs before `npm run build`/`npm test`, and
# tests/data.test.ts fails if the bundles disagree with the curated source.
